.Dd $Mdocdate: September 16 2026 $
.Dt DAEMON-GENERATEDD.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm daemon-generatedd.conf
.Nd daemon-generatedd configuration file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr daemon-generatedd 8
reads its configuration from
.Pa /etc/daemon-generatedd.conf ,
or the file given with
.Fl f .
A missing default file is treated as empty; a missing file given with
.Fl f
is an error.
The file is TOML.
Unknown keys are rejected.
All keys are optional.
.Sh SETTINGS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm socket No = Ar path
Control socket, overridden by
.Fl s .
Must be absolute.
Default:
.Pa /var/run/daemon-generatedd.sock .
.It Cm user No = Ar string
Run as this user after the control socket is created.
.Xr daemon-generatedd 8
must then be started as root.
The socket is owned by this user, mode 0660.
Default: unset, run as the invoking user.
.It Cm interval No = Ar integer
Seconds between runs of the periodic task.
Must be at least 1.
Default: 60.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/daemon-generatedd.conf -compact
.It Pa /etc/daemon-generatedd.conf
Default location.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
socket = "/var/run/daemon-generatedd.sock"
user = "_daemon_generated"
interval = 30
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr daemon-generatedd 8 ,
.Xr daemon-generatedctl 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An your name Aq Mt author@example.com
